+  // needs the IE 10 - Edge 13 or IE 11 fallbacks. Nothing loaded afterwards can
+  // change that answer, so `test/overrides.js` - which the browser runners load
+  // before underscore, but which the node runner loads long after - never
+  // reaches them here. Each case therefore runs in its own process.
